<Layout title="How VendBI works — machine software and mobile management" description="Install VendBI software on compatible TCN and XY vending machines, then manage operations from Android or iOS. Worldwide remote software support is available."><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">FROM FIRST CONVERSATION TO A CONSIDERED ROLLOUT</p><h1>A clear path.<br/>At your pace.</h1><p>Install software on your compatible machine. Manage operations from your phone. Get remote software support wherever you operate.</p></div></section><section class="section pt-0"><div class="container timeline">{[['Confirm your machine setup','VendBI supports compatible TCN and XY vending machines. Share model and controller details so installation requirements and supported workflows can be confirmed.'],['Install VendBI on the machine','Install the VendBI machine software as part of the agreed onboarding process. Setup instructions and account requirements are confirmed for your operation.'],['Manage from your phone','Download the VendBI app for Android or iOS and manage operations from your phone. Confirm the available functions for your machine setup.'],['Get remote software support','VendBI supports operators worldwide remotely for software needs. On-site hardware service is not included in this statement.'],['Explore VBN separately','VBN screen advertising participation requires its own eligibility, integration readiness and commercial assessment. Installing VendBI does not automatically activate advertising.']].map(([t,d],i)=><article><span>0{i+1}</span><div><h2>{t}</h2><p>{d}</p></div></article>)}</div></section><section class="section soft-bg"><div class="container split"><div><p class="eyebrow">ANDROID &amp; IOS</p><h2>Your operation.<br/>Within reach.</h2></div><div><p>Download VendBI from the official app stores. Machine compatibility, setup and account access are confirmed during onboarding.</p><AppLinks/></div></div></section><CTA/></Layout>
